      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPTON AVA (1) shapes as hard to beat after winning last start over the 512m at this track in a useful 29.89. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. JETSON (2) goes very well here starting 16 times for six wins and three minors. In the money last time at this track (29.92) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 6 length third. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. ROCK IT KATHY (7) comes off an average run last start when sixth at this track over 512m behind Paw Danny (30.30) in a Grade 4/5. Scored at her previous run. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Cannot be underestimated. COSTLY HABITS (3) is one of the chances after collecting a minor prize last time.",
